WEBVTT

00:13:29.379 --> 00:13:31.605
Ketika anak perempuan saya

00:13:31.605 --> 00:13:34.497
di ambang hidup dan mati,

00:13:34.497 --> 00:13:38.336
saya berbisik ke telinga istri saya,

00:13:38.336 --> 00:13:41.438
"Apakah salah saya atas apa

00:13:41.438 --> 00:13:45.114
yang menimpa anak perempuan kita?"

00:13:45.114 --> 00:13:47.635
Dan dia tiba-tiba berkata,

00:13:47.635 --> 00:13:50.146
"Tolong jangan salahkan dirimu.

00:13:50.146 --> 00:13:53.362
Kamu membela kebenaran.

00:13:53.362 --> 00:13:55.497
Kamu mempertaruhkan nyawamu

00:13:55.497 --> 00:13:56.900
demi suatu kebenaran,

00:13:56.900 --> 00:13:58.081
demi perdamaian,

00:13:58.081 --> 00:14:00.189
dan demi pendidikan,